# Workflow

Use the existing project entry and current task scope. Plan only when sequencing or recovery benefits.
Implement authorized changes, run `{{verification_command}}` in its target shell, and review at the required risk level.
`review` includes evidence judgment; `verify` is its alias, not another stage. Small changes may finish after focused self-review.
Update affected docs and existing recovery records when facts change. Respect protected-path contracts and current authorization.
